==French==

===Etymology===
Borrowed from {{etyl|la|fr}} ''[[promittere]]'' based on ''[[mettre]]''.

===Pronunciation===
* {{audio|Fr-promettre.ogg|audio|lang=fr}}
* {{IPA|/pʁɔ.mɛtʁ/|lang=fr}}

===Verb===
{{fr-verb}}

# to [[promise]]
#: ''Je te '''promets''' que je te rendrai ton argent avant dimanche.'' (I promise I'll give you your money back before Sunday.)
# {{context|intransitive|lang=fr}} to be [[promising]], to be [[hopeful]].
#: ''C'est une athlète qui '''promet'''.'' (She is a promising athlete.)

====Conjugation====
{{fr-conj-mettre|pro}}

====Derived terms====
* nouns: [[promesse]], [[prometteur]]

====Related terms====
* [[mettre]]

